DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261105
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261108
SUMMARY:EAAMO 2026 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:ACM Conference on Equity and Access in Algorithms\, Mechanisms\
 , and Optimization\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial sour
 ce: https://conference2026.eaamo.org/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.githu
 b.io/venue-radar/#eaamo-2026\nNotes: Sixth ACM EAAMO\, Nov 5-7\, 2026 at 
 LMU Munich\; virtual-only Zoom registration covers keynotes and paper tal
 ks. Abstract/paper deadlines were postponed one week from May 1/8 (AoE). 
 OpenReview's abstract registration stage gates papers\, which choose an a
 rchival (ACM DL\, up to 14 pages camera-ready) or non-archival option\; d
 ouble-blind\, six tracks. WiP posters need only a title and abstract and 
 are not in the proceedings. Size basis is 70 accepted papers (34 orals\, 
 36 posters) and a 150+ seat main hall in the host call. Size is an editor
 ial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Fairness & Responsible AI,Ethics & Governance,Machine Learning
URL:https://conference2026.eaamo.org/
LOCATION:Munich\, Germany
END:VEVENT
