 anizer's call before relying on it.\nOfficial source: https://conference.
 eaamo.org/call_for_location/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venu
 e-radar/#eaamo-2027\nNotes: As of 2026-10-31 conference.eaamo.org covers 
 only EAAMO 2026 and runs a call for 2027 host proposals (timing last week
  of October or first week of November)\; no 2027 host\, dates or call exi
 st. Annual since 2021. Meeting and AoE dates are one-year same-weekday pr
 oxies from EAAMO 2026\, using its original May 1/8 abstract/paper dates\,
  not the one-week postponement (2025 used Apr 24/May 1). The poster proxy
  follows 2026's Sep 7 call\; 2025's closed Jul 25. Mode assumes the virtu
 al option of 2025-2026. Size follows 2026. Size is an editorial estimate.
